From a99b86e3832056f35617b5bb3e17a4e835b6d699 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <c@c>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 07:22:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(controls): wire remaining no-op controls (gems screen
 excluded)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Buddy dashboard 'Available Now' hydrates from saved settings and persists
  via setAvailabilitySettings (was local state born false)
- Waitlist: fabricated Math.random queue position removed — never invent
  server data
- 'Book This Package' now preselects that package in the request form
  (packageId was silently dropped)
- Trip chat: always-on unread dot removed (no unread signal feeds it)
- Trip -> buddy search passes bookingDate the search actually reads
- Onboarding display-name hint corrected to 30 chars (cap is 30)

(gems/index.tsx Near Me + map fix dropped from this patch — the file
changed upstream; it ships separately rebuilt on the current version.)
---
 .../travel-buddy/app/(auth)/onboarding.tsx    |  2 +-
 .../(rent-a-buddy)/buddy-dashboard/index.tsx  | 19 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../app/(rent-a-buddy)/request-buddy.tsx      | 11 +++++++----
 .../app/(rent-a-buddy)/waitlist.tsx           |  4 +++-
 artifacts/travel-buddy/app/trip/[id].tsx      | 18 ++++++++----------
 5 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

